investigators say paul jones concocted a  story about his son aaron's death this  is an interview from jail with 8 news  now in 2017 after the 13 year old's  remains were found  a jury trial was set to begin this week  but instead the attorney for jones filed  this emergency motion for an independent  determination of his competency to stand  trial referring to mental disabilities  along with psychological emotional and  physical trauma throughout his life  according to this 50-page document a  psychologist who evaluated jones  determined he has a severely low iq and  the educational ability of an eight or  nine-year-old he also points to  challenges he faced growing up as a  student with special needs and due to  family neglect and to bullying he faced  according to an arrest report jones  neglected and bullied his son making him  stand against a wall with his arms up  while his siblings were encouraged to  hit him with anything they chose  jones is now charged with murder child  abuse and theft  prosecutors are seeking the death  penalty  on monday clark county district court  judge tierra jones postponed the trial  while jones will be further evaluated  it's hard to believe my son is dead  djanae thomas is erin's biological  mother she sat down with the eye team in  2019. it's  not something that  i would ever understand  there are still many questions  surrounding this case paul jones was on  probation for child abuse when aaron was  placed with him they were also living in  a one-bedroom unit at the seagull suites  with the wife of jones and 11 other  children and aaron jones was missing for  at least four months before he was  reported missing it is clear there were  multiple failures here we expected to  learn more at that trial but it's now  postponed the next court date for jones  is set for january 28th
 

